{
    "title": "NBC Sports Philadelphia",
    "description": "The NBC Sports Philadelphia app is your ultimate teammate! It\u2019s home to your local team news, game recaps, and highlights for the Philadelphia Eagles, Philadelphia Sixers, Philadelphia Phillies, and Philadelphia Flyers.\r\n\r\nNever miss important sports news about your favorite local Philly teams \u2013 whether it\u2019s a milestone moment, notable trade, or key injury \u2013 stay in the know with sports alerts sent right to your phone. Insiders Reuben Frank, Dave Zangaro, Corey Seidman, Noah Levick, Jordan Hall, and the entire NBC Sports Philadelphia station bring you in-depth, in-season, and off-season sports news, analysis, and insights about your favorite Philadelphia teams. Fans can follow live scores, watch pre and post-game interviews and analysis, and customize sports alerts by team. \r\n\r\nThe NBC Sports Philadelphia app offers the following features:\r\n\r\n\r\nAccess to Eagles, Phillies, Sixers and Flyers highlights, Insider analysis, top headlines, and exclusive offers\r\nCustomized push notifications for sports alerts about the Eagles, Phillies, Sixers, and Flyers\r\nAlerts center that shows you the most urgent Philadelphia sports news and sports updates of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\nThe Latest story feed shows the most up-to-date headlines about your Philly teams \r\nA dedicated video section with highlights, pre and post-game interviews & Insider analysis \r\nThe latest scores and stats for your favorite local Philadelphia teams in the NBA, NFL, MLB and NHL\r\nPodcasts from your local teams\u2019 most knowledgeable sources\r\n\r\nNFL News and Updates:\r\nFollow Insider Eagles news and updates of Eagles training camp, Eagles preseason game news, NFL Scouting Combine, NFL Draft, Thanksgiving Day Game analysis, playoffs breaking news, Super Bowl, and Postseason. Get Eagles push notifications for the full NBC Sports Philadelphia experience. \r\n\r\nNBA News and Updates:\r\nNever miss a Sixers moment. Get news and analysis for Sixers pre-season games, Christmas Day Game analysis, NBA All-Star news, NBA Playoffs, trade rumors, The NBA Finals, NBA Draft, NBA Summer League, and breaking news. And don\u2019t forget to sign up for Sixers push alerts for updates on the team and the players. \r\n\r\nMLB News and Updates:\r\nGet Phillies news and updates all season long, including, Philadelphia Phillies spring training, Opening Day, MLB World Classic, MLB Draft, MLB World Tour games news, All-Star coverage, breaking trade news, World Series coverage, and postseason updates. Select Phillies push notifications for the latest team and player news. \r\n\r\nNHL News and Updates:\r\nStay updated with the latest Flyers news and analysis during the Flyers preseason, NHL Draft, All-Star Weekend, Winter Classic, Trade rumors, breaking news during playoffs, Stanley Cup finals news, and more. Get Flyers alerts for the latest player news and team updates. \r\n\r\nNBC Sports Philadelphia is part of the NBCUniversal Local group, which includes nine other NBC stations, 17 Telemundo Stations, and four regional sports networks, including NBC Sports Philadelphia and NECN (New England Cable News).   \r\n\r\nYOUR PRIVACY CHOICES: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?intake=NBC_Sports_Regional_Sports_Network\r\n\r\nCA NOTICE: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=Regional_Sports_Networks",
